{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56027","headline":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 三句外别置一颂（《古尊宿语录》作「问」） · 缘密","name":"颂云门三句语（幷余颂八首） 三句外别置一颂（《古尊宿语录》作「问」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当人如举唱，三句岂能该。\n有问如何事，南岳与天台。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缘密","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}